layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Hell is here.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d5/Hell_is_here..png/revision/latest?cb=20230929170333\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Hell is here.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d5/Hell_is_here..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230929170333\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d5/Hell_is_here..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230929170333 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d5/Hell_is_here..png/revision/latest?cb=20230929170333 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Hell is here.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Hell_is_here..png\" data-image-name=\"Hell is here..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">16</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">2</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\">Sue Perkins</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_natural_friends.\" title=\"The natural friends.\">The natural friends.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Languidly.\" title=\"Languidly.\">Languidly.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Hell is here.</b></i> is the second episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_16\" title=\"Series 16\">Series 16</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 28 September 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\">Sue Perkins</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hell_is_here.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Hell is here\" was uttered by <a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\">Susan Wokoma</a>, during her defence of her nails and wire portrait, in the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_cheeky_picture_on_wood_using_nails_and_one_continuous_piece_of_wire\" title=\"Make a cheeky picture on wood using nails and one continuous piece of wire\">Make a cheeky picture on wood using nails and one continuous piece of wire</a> task. The title card is of a drawn beach image on a nail's head, with the nail referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_cheeky_picture_on_wood_using_nails_and_one_continuous_piece_of_wire\" title=\"Make a cheeky picture on wood using nails and one continuous piece of wire\">Make a cheeky picture on wood using nails and one continuous piece of wire</a> task. The drawn beach on the nail's head may be a reference to the <a href=\"/wiki/Draw_your_like_and_dislike_at_the_same_time\" title=\"Draw your like and dislike at the same time\">Draw your like and dislike at the same time</a> task, though this appears unlikely.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hell_is_here.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Helvetti on valloillaan', which translates as 'Hell is unleashed'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Helvetet är här', which translates as 'Hell is here'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Helvete er her', which translates as 'Hell is here'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hell_is_here.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Julian_Clary\" title=\"Julian Clary\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Julian Clary</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Lucy_Beaumont\" title=\"Lucy Beaumont\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Lucy Beaumont</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sam_Campbell\" title=\"Sam Campbell\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sam Campbell</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sue_Perkins\" title=\"Sue Perkins\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sue Perkins</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Susan_Wokoma\" title=\"Susan Wokoma\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Susan Wokoma</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_sign\" title=\"Best sign\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best sign.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pull_the_sword_from_the_stone\" title=\"Pull the sword from the stone\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Pull the sword from the stone. You may not force the sword or break the stone.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_a_cheeky_picture_on_wood_using_nails_and_one_continuous_piece_of_wire\" title=\"Make a cheeky picture on wood using nails and one continuous piece of wire\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make a cheeky picture on this piece of wood using nails and one continuous piece of wire. Also, if any egg timers stop, you must stare at the camera shaking your head for 10 seconds.\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_mischief\" title=\"Make mischief\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make mischief.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Draw_your_like_and_dislike_at_the_same_time\" title=\"Draw your like and dislike at the same time\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Write down one thing you like and one thing you don't like.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">1\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">3\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Live:</b> Draw your two things at the same time. You must be drawing with both hands and stare at the Taskmaster throughout.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Learn_pi_to_the_most_decimal_places\" title=\"Learn pi to the most decimal places\">T</a>\n</td>\n<td>Learn pi to the most decimal places.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>✔</b>\n</td>\n<td>✘\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>10\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">19\n</td>\n<td>19\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Hell_is_here.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\